*> vybe-test: cobol/occurs_depending_on/test_odo_structural
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_occurs_depending_on.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 2.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-ITEM PIC X(3) OCCURS 1 TO 10 TIMES DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE "ONE" TO WS-ITEM(1).
    MOVE "TWO" TO WS-ITEM(2).
    DISPLAY WS-ITEM(1).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ITEM(1) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ONE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ONE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-ITEM(2).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ITEM(2) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "TWO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [TWO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

